    <string name="settings_hotspot_help_cd">Hotspot setup guide</string>
    <string name="settings_hotspot_guide_title">Server Hotspot (Samsung)</string>
    <string name="settings_hotspot_guide_message">⚠ Works only if Server is running on a Samsung phone with One UI 5+.\n\nSetup on the Server phone:\n1. Open Settings → Modes and Routines → Routines tab → tap \"+\".\n2. Create the 1st routine (Turn ON):\n• If: \"Notification received\"\n• App: BTRouterServer\n• Notification with specific keyword: BTR_HOTSPOT_ON\n• Then: Connections → Mobile Hotspot → On\n• Under \"When routine ends\", choose \"Don\'t reverse\" (disable auto-revert)\n• Save the routine.\n3. Create the 2nd routine (Turn OFF):\n• If: \"Notification received\"\n• App: BTRouterServer\n• Notification with specific keyword: BTR_HOTSPOT_OFF\n• Then: Connections → Mobile Hotspot → Off\n• Save the routine.\n4. Make sure notifications (POST_NOTIFICATIONS) are allowed for BTRouterServer on Server.</string>
    <string name="btn_understood">OK</string>
